OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FSome brightness possible to
OL,6,Fstart the day, but soon turning cloudy
OL,7,Fwith outbreaks of rain, these turning
OL,8,Fheavy at times during the afternoon.
OL,9,FWinds starting light, but becoming
OL,10,Fbreezy later in the day.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FRain to start the evening
OL,13,Fwill clear towards midnight, to leave
OL,14,Flargely dry conditions with clear
OL,15,Fspells. Becoming chilly with a frost
OL,16,Fdeveloping in places. Winds easing
OL,17,Fthrough the night.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
