OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FA chilly start, but
OL,6,Fgenerally a bright day with sunny
OL,7,Fspells and a few isolated showers,
OL,8,Fmainly in the south and west. Winds
OL,9,Fmostly light throughout. Rain arriving
OL,10,Flate evening.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FUnsettled
OL,13,Fduring this period with showers or
OL,14,Flonger spells of rain throughout.
OL,15,FOften windy or very windy at times,
OL,16,Fwith a risk of gales. Temperatures
OL,17,Faround average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
